  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "7281201",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Junkichi",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "728120101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "728120101": {
            "id": "728120101",
            "speakerId": 3032,
            "speakerName": "Junkichi",
            "text": "...So this is the structure I have in mind this time.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728120102"
            ]
          },
          "728120102": {
            "id": "728120102",
            "speakerId": 3032,
            "speakerName": "Junkichi",
            "text": "The supremely-skilled ninja uses all sorts of abilities to infiltrate the enemy fortress and retrieve the required intel in secret...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728120103"
            ]
          },
          "728120103": {
            "id": "728120103",
            "speakerId": 3033,
            "speakerName": "Shigeru",
            "text": "*sigh* And how many \"abilities\" are you going to give this ninja this time?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728120104"
            ]
          },
          "728120104": {
            "id": "728120104",
            "speakerId": 3032,
            "speakerName": "Junkichi",
            "text": "Th—That, uh, might depend on the situation?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728120105"
            ]
          },
          "728120105": {
            "id": "728120105",
            "speakerId": 3033,
            "speakerName": "Shigeru",
            "text": "Right. So you haven't thought about it, then.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728120106"
            ]
          },
          "728120106": {
            "id": "728120106",
            "speakerId": 3032,
            "speakerName": "Junkichi",
            "text": "I mean, it's fine! I mean, if you lock down all the narrative devices ahead of time, there's nowhere to adapt from there, right?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728120107"
            ]
          },
          "728120107": {
            "id": "728120107",
            "speakerId": 3033,
            "speakerName": "Shigeru",
            "text": "Oh, here you go again. If you had these devices locked in beforehand, your writing wouldn't go all over the shop!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728120108"
            ]
          },
          "728120108": {
            "id": "728120108",
            "speakerId": 3032,
            "speakerName": "Junkichi",
            "text": "I—I have my own creative methods, alright? The story should put its narrative first. How can it be shackled by these devices?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728120109"
            ]
          },
          "728120109": {
            "id": "728120109",
            "speakerId": 3033,
            "speakerName": "Shigeru",
            "text": "That's just irresponsible, you...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728120110"
            ]
          },
          "728120110": {
            "id": "728120110",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "What are you two arguing about?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728120111"
            ]
          },
          "728120111": {
            "id": "728120111",
            "speakerId": 3032,
            "speakerName": "Junkichi",
            "text": "Oh, its you! I was just thinking about to structure a novel about a ninja.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728120112"
            ]
          },
          "728120112": {
            "id": "728120112",
            "speakerId": 3032,
            "speakerName": "Junkichi",
            "text": "But Shigeru's criticizing the structures that I came up with again...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728120113"
            ]
          },
          "728120113": {
            "id": "728120113",
            "speakerId": 3033,
            "speakerName": "Shigeru",
            "text": "I'm not saying that what you've come up with is bad, per se. I'm just asking you to put your narrative devices in place first before you start writing...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728120114"
            ]
          },
          "728120114": {
            "id": "728120114",
            "speakerId": 3032,
            "speakerName": "Junkichi",
            "text": "No, no... I'm not going to list them all down and structure the narrative around them. That's just too staid!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728120115"
            ]
          },
          "728120115": {
            "id": "728120115",
            "speakerId": 3032,
            "speakerName": "Junkichi",
            "text": "The narrative is the most important thing in the novel, which everything else revolves around, even the setting and narrative devices...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728120116"
            ]
          },
          "728120116": {
            "id": "728120116",
            "speakerId": 3033,
            "speakerName": "Shigeru",
            "text": "You...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728120117"
            ]
          },
          "728120117": {
            "id": "728120117",
            "speakerId": 3032,
            "speakerName": "Junkichi",
            "text": "I...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728120120"
            ]
          },
          "728120120": {
            "id": "728120120",
            "speakerId": 3033,
            "speakerName": "Shigeru",
            "text": "Forget it, you're not going to listen to me anyway...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728120121"
            ]
          },
          "728120121": {
            "id": "728120121",
            "speakerId": 3032,
            "speakerName": "Junkichi",
            "text": "I'm sticking to my creative principles no matter what you say.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728120122"
            ]
          },
          "728120122": {
            "id": "728120122",
            "speakerId": 3033,
            "speakerName": "Shigeru",
            "text": "*sigh* ...You know what, Traveler? Since you're here, why don't you be the judge?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7281204",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Junkichi",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7281202",
      "subQuestName": "Get a feel for Junkichi's story",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "728120201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "728120201": {
            "id": "728120201",
            "speakerId": 3032,
            "speakerName": "Junkichi",
            "text": "Alright, that's a wrap.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728120202"
            ]
          },
          "728120202": {
            "id": "728120202",
            "speakerId": 3032,
            "speakerName": "Junkichi",
            "text": "I've... never been this tired. Was this story always that complicated...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728120203"
            ]
          },
          "728120203": {
            "id": "728120203",
            "speakerId": 3033,
            "speakerName": "Shigeru",
            "text": "That's what you get when you don't decide on things early. Without narrative devices to restrain you, the various elements just clash wildly against each other.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728120204"
            ]
          },
          "728120204": {
            "id": "728120204",
            "speakerId": 3033,
            "speakerName": "Shigeru",
            "text": "When that happens, you'll end up losing control over the plot altogether. You'd exhaust yourself no matter what you were writing.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728120205"
            ]
          },
          "728120205": {
            "id": "728120205",
            "speakerId": 3032,
            "speakerName": "Junkichi",
            "text": "*sigh* Alright, alright... I've got no strength left to argue with you. Traveler, thanks for your... judgment.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728120206"
            ]
          },
          "728120206": {
            "id": "728120206",
            "speakerId": 3032,
            "speakerName": "Junkichi",
            "text": "I think I've gained a lot from this...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728120207"
            ]
          },
          "728120207": {
            "id": "728120207",
            "speakerId": 3032,
            "speakerName": "Junkichi",
            "text": "Take this as a token of my thanks. I'll get to writing again shortly.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728120208"
            ]
          },
          "728120208": {
            "id": "728120208",
            "speakerId": 3032,
            "speakerName": "Junkichi",
            "text": "Hmm, narrative devices or narrative... Which is more important?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7281203",
